{"id":"n85576-1-8","stage":4,"title":"한약 · 韩药","scene":"生活与经历","roles":["说话人 A","说话人 B"],"lines":[{"id":"n85576-1-8-1","ko":"뭐야, 이 한약 냄새는?","zh":"怎么有股韩药味？","note":"点不懂的词，看本句词义、助词和语尾；听词语后，再听整句。","parts":[{"text":"뭐야,","meaning":"什么，怎么回事","explanation":"뭐：什么，怎么回事；이다：表示“是”的判断形式。；야：非敬语判断或疑问句末，常与 이다 连用。","readings":[{"term":"뭐","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"84991","senseId":"3","lemma":"뭐","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"뭐야","audio":"/audio/4ec8ab9dc5310ffa76e8.mp3"}},{"text":"이","meaning":"这个","explanation":"이：这个","readings":[{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"27527","senseId":"1","lemma":"이","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"이","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3"}},{"text":"한약","meaning":"韩药，汉药，中药","explanation":"한약：韩药，汉药，中药","readings":[{"term":"한약","audio":"/audio/3311393808fc13f2a908.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"85576","senseId":"1","lemma":"한약","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"한약","audio":"/audio/3311393808fc13f2a908.mp3"}},{"text":"냄새는?","meaning":"气味，味道，香味，臭味","explanation":"냄새：气味，味道，香味，臭味；는：话题或对比助词。","readings":[{"term":"냄새","audio":"/audio/a67d0d1b921d4bc49922.mp3"}],"sources":[{"entryId":"58180","senseId":"1","lemma":"냄새","origin":"NIKL Korean-Chinese dictionary"}],"surfaceReading":{"term":"냄새는","audio":"/audio/21cbf23a9eaf8800176c.mp3"}}],"words":[{"id":"95b5c8cf1b249b7a","term":"뭐","zh":"什么，怎么回事","audio":"/audio/95b5c8cf1b249b7a376b.mp3","entryId":"84991","definition":"对于已经发生的意外事件或状况，强调自己的惊讶、后悔、遗憾的话。","pronunciation":["뭐ː"]},{"id":"8bafb6b7d17ead49","term":"이","zh":"这个","audio":"/audio/8bafb6b7d17ead4985bf.mp3","entryId":"27527","definition":"指代离说话人较近的，或说话人所想的对象。","pronunciation":["이"]},{"id":"3311393808fc13f2","term":"한약","zh":"韩药，汉药，中药","audio":"/audio/3311393808fc13f2a908.mp3","entryId":"85576","definition":"韩国的传统医术韩医中使用的药物。","pronunciation":["하ː냑"]},{"id":"a6